1
00:00:06,583 --> 00:00:08,833
(Aoba Dormitory)

2
00:00:12,208 --> 00:00:17,333
Ugh... I have to share a room
with a freshman starting today.

3
00:00:17,458 --> 00:00:18,833
What a pain.

4
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:22,208
Tell me about it. We have to
teach him everything from scratch.

5
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:25,708
But Sui must be pretty excited, right?

6
00:00:26,167 --> 00:00:27,958
Yeah, I can't wait.

7
00:00:28,083 --> 00:00:30,792
I hope he's my type.

8
00:00:30,917 --> 00:00:32,625
Yeah, right. Like that's gonna happen.

9
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,333
He wouldn't be into you anyway.

10
00:00:34,875 --> 00:00:35,625
Hey, hey.

11
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,476
Don't go sneaking up
on him while he's asleep.

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,500
I would never do something like that!

13
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:42,375
I'm heading out.

14
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,833
See ya.

15
00:00:46,417 --> 00:00:49,083
That guy is always goofing around.

16
00:00:49,208 --> 00:00:51,125
You're being too loud.

17
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,417
I said you're being too loud!

18
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:55,792
(2025 Sofu High School Entrance Ceremony)

19
00:00:55,917 --> 00:00:59,417
Congratulations on your enrollment.

20
00:01:00,542 --> 00:01:03,292
From this day forward, before you...

21
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:07,473
lies a grand path called "encounters."

22
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:42,958
(Apple Pie)

23
00:01:44,042 --> 00:01:45,333
Nice to meet you.

24
00:01:45,458 --> 00:01:47,375
I'm Kurobe Harutora.

25
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,125
I love playing basketball.

26
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:50,958
I look forward to living with you.

27
00:01:56,833 --> 00:01:59,042
Um...

28
00:02:01,208 --> 00:02:02,750
You're being too formal.

29
00:02:02,875 --> 00:02:04,458
I'm Kishida Sui, a sophomore.

30
00:02:04,583 --> 00:02:05,958
Nice to meet you too.

31
00:02:06,083 --> 00:02:07,417
Okay.

32
00:02:14,083 --> 00:02:15,375
No need to be so tense.

33
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,292
You must be exhausted from the long trip.

34
00:02:17,417 --> 00:02:19,542
Make yourself at home.

35
00:02:23,458 --> 00:02:25,333
By the way, what should I call you?

36
00:02:27,708 --> 00:02:28,583
Um...

37
00:02:28,708 --> 00:02:30,167
What's your first name?

38
00:02:33,125 --> 00:02:35,542
Let's just go by first names.

39
00:02:35,667 --> 00:02:37,000
Harutora, huh?

40
00:02:37,125 --> 00:02:39,333
I'll call you Harutora then.

41
00:02:39,458 --> 00:02:42,292
You can just call me Sui.

42
00:02:44,917 --> 00:02:46,809
I don't think I should call an
upperclassman by his first name.

43
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:49,625
Ah, good point.

44
00:03:38,083 --> 00:03:40,958
Hold on, Harutora-kun Episode 1.

45
00:03:41,458 --> 00:03:44,000
(Sofu High School)

46
00:03:48,583 --> 00:03:50,292
Focus.

47
00:03:51,542 --> 00:03:53,125
Keep your head in the game.

48
00:04:03,708 --> 00:04:04,708
No way.

49
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:06,590
He's literally a real-life
Hanamichi Sakuragi.

50
00:04:17,292 --> 00:04:18,292
Welcome back.

51
00:04:18,417 --> 00:04:20,458
Wow, that's amazing.

52
00:04:21,167 --> 00:04:23,007
I got a little too carried
away with practice.

53
00:04:23,125 --> 00:04:24,500
I see.

54
00:04:39,542 --> 00:04:41,375
Oh, I got it.

55
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,875
No, it's fine.

56
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,417
I'm free anyway.

57
00:04:44,542 --> 00:04:46,500
I'll clean this up while I'm at it.

58
00:04:50,333 --> 00:04:51,375
Um...

59
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:52,583
Senpai.

60
00:04:52,708 --> 00:04:55,042
- Yeah?
- Do you want to go take a bath together?

61
00:04:55,167 --> 00:04:56,500
Huh?

62
00:04:56,625 --> 00:04:58,208
You helped me clean up.

63
00:04:58,333 --> 00:04:59,853
Let me scrub your back as a thank you.

64
00:05:00,208 --> 00:05:01,208
No, that's okay!

65
00:05:01,250 --> 00:05:03,000
I usually just take a shower.

66
00:05:03,125 --> 00:05:03,958
Oh, really?

67
00:05:04,083 --> 00:05:05,375
Yeah.

68
00:05:06,250 --> 00:05:09,083
The large public bath
is really relaxing, though.

69
00:05:09,208 --> 00:05:10,500
I bet.

70
00:05:10,625 --> 00:05:13,292
I'd actually love to take a soak.

71
00:05:33,625 --> 00:05:35,042
Heading to practice?

72
00:05:38,083 --> 00:05:40,417
Oh, did I wake you?

73
00:05:40,542 --> 00:05:41,208
I'm sorry.

74
00:05:41,333 --> 00:05:44,333
No, it's just... you do this
every day. That's intense.

75
00:05:51,083 --> 00:05:52,625
Not really.

76
00:05:53,208 --> 00:05:55,750
It's the exact opposite.

77
00:05:56,458 --> 00:05:57,917
What do you mean?

78
00:06:02,542 --> 00:06:04,792
Go, Harutora!

79
00:06:08,958 --> 00:06:10,625
Um...

80
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:14,125
Does this really help you?

81
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:17,292
Yeah, it really pumps me up.

82
00:06:18,375 --> 00:06:22,333
After starting high school, I realized
there are so many amazing players.

83
00:06:22,458 --> 00:06:26,125
It made me realize how
full of myself I used to be.

84
00:06:26,250 --> 00:06:28,130
It's pretty embarrassing
when I think about it.

85
00:06:28,958 --> 00:06:31,000
So, thank you so much.

86
00:06:32,083 --> 00:06:34,792
Really? In that case...

87
00:06:35,375 --> 00:06:38,083
Go, Harutora!

88
00:06:38,208 --> 00:06:39,500
Number one in Japan!

89
00:06:39,625 --> 00:06:43,125
Absolute starting lineup!

90
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:48,542
Tall, handsome, and rocking a six-pack!

91
00:06:48,667 --> 00:06:51,375
Senpai, that's a bit...

92
00:06:57,792 --> 00:07:01,792
Wow, that's amazing! Seriously?

93
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:05,750
Let's not get carried away.

94
00:07:06,875 --> 00:07:08,208
Senpai?

95
00:07:08,875 --> 00:07:11,958
Nothing, I was just worried I
was being too loud and annoying.

96
00:07:12,083 --> 00:07:14,167
Not at all.

97
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:16,500
R-Right.

98
00:07:17,917 --> 00:07:21,750
By the way, aren't you
hot wearing that mask?

99
00:07:21,875 --> 00:07:23,083
Huh?

100
00:07:23,208 --> 00:07:24,833
Wouldn't it be better to take it off?

101
00:07:25,208 --> 00:07:26,833
Well...

102
00:07:27,417 --> 00:07:29,375
I've worn it so long it's become a habit.

103
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:32,958
I actually feel shy taking it off now.

104
00:07:33,083 --> 00:07:34,083
Shy?

105
00:07:34,208 --> 00:07:35,417
Yeah.

106
00:07:35,542 --> 00:07:37,208
Why?

107
00:07:42,667 --> 00:07:43,833
I'm sorry.

108
00:07:43,958 --> 00:07:45,250
Forget I asked.

109
00:07:45,375 --> 00:07:47,917
It's fine, it's not like I'm
embarrassed to talk about it.

110
00:07:48,375 --> 00:07:52,500
Um... do you ever have those moments...

111
00:07:52,625 --> 00:07:55,792
When you don't want to smile,
but you feel like you have to?

112
00:07:58,875 --> 00:08:01,667
Guess not. Makes sense.

113
00:08:01,792 --> 00:08:03,625
I get that a lot, actually.

114
00:08:04,417 --> 00:08:07,292
Then I realized that wearing a
mask makes it look like I'm smiling.

115
00:08:07,417 --> 00:08:10,875
I've been wearing it ever since.

116
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
Now that you mention it, Senpai...

117
00:08:13,125 --> 00:08:15,458
Your eyes do look like they're smiling.

118
00:08:16,333 --> 00:08:17,708
Yeah.

119
00:08:19,083 --> 00:08:20,875
I think it's really cute.

120
00:08:25,625 --> 00:08:27,458
Oh... sorry.

121
00:08:27,583 --> 00:08:30,250
It's probably rude to call
an upperclassman "cute."

122
00:08:30,375 --> 00:08:32,542
No, not at all! I'm flattered.

123
00:08:32,667 --> 00:08:34,458
Seriously, I'm thrilled!

124
00:08:34,583 --> 00:08:36,083
Really.

125
00:08:36,208 --> 00:08:38,000
So thrilled...

126
00:08:44,792 --> 00:08:46,250
Senpai.

127
00:08:47,250 --> 00:08:48,583
Yeah?

128
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,917
I'm... definitely going to
earn a spot on the court.

129
00:08:55,125 --> 00:08:58,250
Come watch me play when I do.

130
00:08:58,375 --> 00:09:00,500
Really? Can I?

131
00:09:01,083 --> 00:09:02,083
Yeah.

132
00:09:02,792 --> 00:09:06,083
Seriously? I'm in! I'll
definitely be there.

133
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:13,250
Wow, that's awesome!

134
00:09:14,208 --> 00:09:15,708
56.

135
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,083
57.

136
00:09:19,208 --> 00:09:20,917
58.

137
00:09:21,625 --> 00:09:23,250
59.

138
00:09:23,917 --> 00:09:25,417
60.

139
00:09:36,292 --> 00:09:37,833
Amazing.

140
00:09:39,792 --> 00:09:41,250
Ready...

141
00:09:41,375 --> 00:09:42,417
Go!

142
00:09:44,208 --> 00:09:45,708
So fast...

143
00:09:45,833 --> 00:09:47,500
He really is fast.

144
00:09:52,042 --> 00:09:54,583
They're announcing it tomorrow.

145
00:09:54,708 --> 00:09:56,083
So...

146
00:09:57,625 --> 00:09:59,208
I see...

147
00:09:59,792 --> 00:10:01,083
I hope you get...

148
00:10:01,208 --> 00:10:02,875
Your very own jersey.

149
00:10:04,667 --> 00:10:05,958
Yeah.

150
00:10:12,625 --> 00:10:14,250
Welcome!

151
00:10:15,083 --> 00:10:16,750
Everything's on sale!

152
00:10:16,875 --> 00:10:19,333
Special prices today!

153
00:10:19,458 --> 00:10:21,208
Strawberries, lemons!

154
00:10:21,333 --> 00:10:23,125
Bananas are cheap too!

155
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:24,042
Come on in, welcome!

156
00:10:24,167 --> 00:10:26,625
Cheap, everything's cheap!

157
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:30,208
Bananas, strawberries, melons, all on sale!

158
00:10:31,292 --> 00:10:33,625
Lemons are especially cheap today!

159
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:35,417
Great deals!

160
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Mmm, so sweet.

161
00:11:09,167 --> 00:11:10,500
Oh.

162
00:11:13,875 --> 00:11:15,958
Oh, you made this yourself?

163
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:18,167
Is it for your girlfriend?

164
00:11:18,292 --> 00:11:20,250
No way, idiot.

165
00:11:20,375 --> 00:11:22,083
Then who's it for?

166
00:11:23,083 --> 00:11:25,583
Not everyone is into girls, you know.

167
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:29,000
Huh? So you mean...

168
00:11:42,500 --> 00:11:46,200
(Sorry)

169
00:12:12,625 --> 00:12:14,167
Harutora.

170
00:12:14,833 --> 00:12:16,542
Leaving so soon?

171
00:12:16,667 --> 00:12:18,000
Yeah.

172
00:12:19,542 --> 00:12:22,375
Good luck, I'll be rooting for you.

173
00:12:28,917 --> 00:12:29,917
Senpai.

174
00:12:30,792 --> 00:12:31,958
Yeah?

175
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:34,750
I...

176
00:12:35,792 --> 00:12:38,708
Didn't get a jersey.

177
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:43,792
I'm sorry.

178
00:12:43,917 --> 00:12:46,458
Even though you cheered so hard for me.

179
00:12:49,125 --> 00:12:51,500
W-Wait a sec.

180
00:12:52,333 --> 00:12:53,833
Um...

181
00:12:57,208 --> 00:12:58,667
Here...

182
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:02,458
Take this, if you don't mind.

183
00:13:02,583 --> 00:13:04,783
Even if you can't play, you
should still eat something.

184
00:13:05,333 --> 00:13:07,458
It's good for you, so make sure you eat it!

185
00:13:21,625 --> 00:13:23,167
Actually...

186
00:13:23,292 --> 00:13:26,542
I... accidentally saw...

187
00:13:26,667 --> 00:13:28,333
This in the fridge yesterday.

188
00:13:29,625 --> 00:13:32,625
I was actually hoping it was for me.

189
00:13:33,667 --> 00:13:35,917
So I'm really happy.

190
00:13:38,667 --> 00:13:41,208
I'm heading out, Senpai.

191
00:13:42,542 --> 00:13:44,333
Harutora...

192
00:14:12,125 --> 00:14:15,125
(Lounge and Dining Hall)

193
00:14:19,292 --> 00:14:20,875
I wonder if they won.

194
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,542
Did they win?

195
00:14:27,375 --> 00:14:28,875
Or did they lose?

196
00:14:29,292 --> 00:14:32,125
N-No way.

197
00:14:32,458 --> 00:14:34,250
Won?

198
00:14:34,375 --> 00:14:35,708
Lost?

199
00:14:35,833 --> 00:14:36,500
Stop overthinking it.
Senpai.

200
00:14:37,542 --> 00:14:38,250
Huh?

201
00:14:38,375 --> 00:14:39,500
I'm back.

202
00:14:39,625 --> 00:14:42,167
Y-You're back, Harutora.

203
00:14:42,875 --> 00:14:44,875
H-How was the game?

204
00:14:50,542 --> 00:14:51,792
My voice...

205
00:14:51,917 --> 00:14:53,625
I lost my voice.

206
00:14:57,333 --> 00:14:59,667
Oh, from cheering too loud?

207
00:15:01,208 --> 00:15:02,792
Yeah.

208
00:15:05,167 --> 00:15:06,542
I see.

209
00:15:07,583 --> 00:15:09,250
We won.

210
00:15:10,042 --> 00:15:12,667
Con... Congratulations.

211
00:15:13,375 --> 00:15:15,167
The honey lemon

212
00:15:16,333 --> 00:15:19,333
you made, Senpai...

213
00:15:19,458 --> 00:15:21,083
was really good.

214
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:24,667
I ate it all by myself.

215
00:15:25,833 --> 00:15:27,208
By yourself?

216
00:15:27,333 --> 00:15:28,750
You ate it all?

217
00:15:29,833 --> 00:15:31,042
Yeah.

218
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:42,167
Ah~ Sui is hitting on an underclassman.

219
00:15:42,292 --> 00:15:43,042
Hold on...

220
00:15:43,167 --> 00:15:45,167
I am not.

221
00:15:45,292 --> 00:15:47,167
I just lost my balance.

222
00:15:47,708 --> 00:15:48,708
Oh, really?

223
00:15:48,833 --> 00:15:51,333
You better watch out, freshman.

224
00:15:52,458 --> 00:15:54,125
Didn't you know?

225
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:56,417
This guy is gay.

226
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:00,833
Hey, you're scaring him.

227
00:16:00,958 --> 00:16:03,042
You're crossing the line.

228
00:16:03,167 --> 00:16:04,458
Huh?

229
00:16:11,333 --> 00:16:16,417
S-Sorry, Harutora. That
must have startled you.

230
00:16:16,542 --> 00:16:17,833
But don't worry.

231
00:16:17,958 --> 00:16:20,750
I'm into those flashy party animals.

232
00:16:20,875 --> 00:16:24,583
I have absolutely no interest
in a serious guy like you, Harutora.

233
00:16:26,917 --> 00:16:28,708
Doesn't that make me exactly his type?

234
00:16:29,292 --> 00:16:31,583
How are you a party animal?

235
00:16:31,708 --> 00:16:33,958
How am I not?

236
00:16:34,083 --> 00:16:35,163
I'm totally a party animal.

237
00:16:35,250 --> 00:16:36,792
- I'm a party animal.
- Yeah... sure.

238
00:16:36,917 --> 00:16:38,917
- I'm totally your type, right?
- Yeah.

239
00:17:05,125 --> 00:17:08,542
Sui, what are you looking at?

240
00:17:08,667 --> 00:17:10,587
(My Heart / Gay Encounters / Matchmaking)
Senpai.

241
00:17:11,667 --> 00:17:13,083
Huh...

242
00:17:14,167 --> 00:17:17,625
Do you actually like guys?

243
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:45,958
(Sorry.)

244
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:05,208
Stand up.

245
00:18:09,208 --> 00:18:10,583
Bow.

246
00:18:10,875 --> 00:18:13,167
- Thank you, sir.
- Thank you, sir.

247
00:18:13,958 --> 00:18:15,375
- I'm so tired.
- Let's go.

248
00:18:15,917 --> 00:18:19,667
- Where should we hang out later?
- Let's figure it out on the way.

249
00:18:19,833 --> 00:18:24,333
- I'm so bored.
- Let's find something fun to do.

250
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,000
You...
(Sorry.)
You like guys?

251
00:18:36,001 --> 00:18:37,917
This guy is gay.

252
00:18:54,708 --> 00:18:56,208
Welcome back.

253
00:18:57,958 --> 00:18:59,583
What is this...?

254
00:18:59,708 --> 00:19:02,958
You like party animals, right, Senpai?

255
00:19:05,375 --> 00:19:09,208
Party animals means
"Party People," right?

256
00:19:11,417 --> 00:19:12,417
Yeah...

257
00:19:13,958 --> 00:19:18,042
So, I went to my friend's room
yesterday and put this together.

258
00:19:18,250 --> 00:19:19,750
Huh?

259
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:30,792
Um...

260
00:19:32,583 --> 00:19:35,042
I'm sorry for making you worry about me.

261
00:19:35,743 --> 00:19:37,285
I'm really sorry!

262
00:19:43,667 --> 00:19:47,708
Because you always smile at me,

263
00:19:47,833 --> 00:19:54,417
I thought maybe
you actually liked me...

264
00:19:56,208 --> 00:19:59,292
Turns out I was wrong.

265
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:07,375
So I thought I'd at least
try to become your type.

266
00:20:09,167 --> 00:20:12,875
Um... I might not be there yet.

267
00:20:13,750 --> 00:20:15,833
But I'll keep trying.

268
00:20:15,958 --> 00:20:23,292
I hope you can feel
relaxed when you're with me.

269
00:20:25,375 --> 00:20:29,833
I look forward to our time together.

270
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:37,500
N-No, Harutora.

271
00:20:38,708 --> 00:20:40,208
It's not like that.

272
00:20:43,167 --> 00:20:44,583
Um...

273
00:20:46,333 --> 00:20:49,250
I thought that if you knew
I didn't see you that way,

274
00:20:49,375 --> 00:20:51,625
you'd feel more at ease.

275
00:20:52,542 --> 00:20:57,207
So... I lied and said
I liked party animals.

276
00:21:01,833 --> 00:21:04,542
And the reason I wear a mask is...

277
00:21:05,958 --> 00:21:08,833
After everyone found out I was gay,

278
00:21:11,708 --> 00:21:13,875
I really couldn't bring myself to smile.

279
00:21:16,208 --> 00:21:17,833
That's why...

280
00:21:29,583 --> 00:21:31,125
But...

281
00:21:33,042 --> 00:21:35,042
when I'm with you, Harutora,

282
00:21:35,167 --> 00:21:37,208
I'm smiling from the bottom of my heart.

283
00:21:37,333 --> 00:21:38,833
It's the truth.

284
00:21:42,708 --> 00:21:44,167
Um...

285
00:21:44,583 --> 00:21:46,208
Then, only when you're with me,

286
00:21:46,333 --> 00:21:48,542
could you take your mask off?

287
00:21:49,125 --> 00:21:50,625
Huh?

288
00:21:50,833 --> 00:21:52,708
Because when you wear a mask,

289
00:21:52,833 --> 00:21:55,833
I might not be able to
tell even if you're upset.

290
00:21:57,042 --> 00:21:58,625
Is that a no?

291
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,375
It's not that I don't want to.

292
00:22:00,500 --> 00:22:01,917
Is that a no?

293
00:22:02,625 --> 00:22:04,083
It's not a no.

294
00:22:05,333 --> 00:22:08,583
Please, Senpai.

295
00:22:12,708 --> 00:22:15,333
But... I still get shy.

296
00:22:20,583 --> 00:22:22,208
I'm sorry.

297
00:22:24,625 --> 00:22:27,375
I think I really like it
when you get shy, Senpai.

298
00:22:29,417 --> 00:22:31,458
It's really cute.

299
00:22:33,833 --> 00:22:35,500
Cute?

300
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:45,580
(Next Episode Preview)

301
00:23:45,583 --> 00:23:48,292
Being with Harutora just feels so natural.

302
00:23:48,417 --> 00:23:50,208
I actually feel really lucky.

303
00:23:50,333 --> 00:23:52,292
I can never figure out what he's thinking.

304
00:23:52,417 --> 00:23:54,000
So even if he looks like he's smiling,

305
00:23:54,125 --> 00:23:55,667
there are times when he's reluctant.

306
00:23:55,792 --> 00:23:59,542
(This drama is purely fictional.)
So... this is what you want, right, Senpai?
